ic during Early Access.As for balancing, several cards have been","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T17:52:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067944937","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3303720-1839676055888981","game_id":"steam-3303720","kind":"update","title":"Demo - Update 3.0.7","summary":"In this update, we revisited several card illustrations that felt slightly inconsistent with the rest of the set, giving them a visual touch-up. We also refined part of the card wording to make effects less verbose and easier to understand. To support these changes, several card effects have been reworked to improve clarity and usability.Additionally, we've reworked cards featuring the Auto() effect, which proved to be harder to understand and use than intended. To address this, we've introduced","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-31T17:45:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055888981","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3303720-1833334318573633","game_id":"steam-3303720","kind":"update","title":"Demo - Update 3.0.6","summary":"In this patch, we updated several illustrations to better match the overall visual style of the game, and decided to nerf two archetypes that had a bit too much dynamite compared to the rest, causing them to consistently overperform during playtesting.Undead had a very consistent gameplan that allowed them to deal large amounts of unavoidable damage. To tone them down, we reduced the physical stats of their key units, making their board presence less overwhelming.Acid Spirit’s effect was simply ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-23T10:20:01Z","ti